  {
    
    "name": "Section 12",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-607819224433558102 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=607819224231969366&sectionId=607819224433558102)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv3crtgr-h_text","label":"ggv3crtgr-h_text","default":"Frequently Asked <span style=\"color:#3A5A40;\"><i>Questions</i></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_0","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_0","default":"<p>How is FusiForce different from other creatine gummies?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_1","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_1","default":"<p>Can women take FusiForce Creatine Gummies?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_2","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_2","default":"<p>How much creatine is in each serving of FusiForce?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_3","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_3","default":"<p>Is FusiForce third-party tested and verified for purity?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_4","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_4","default":"<p>Why pouches with individual serving bags?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_5","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_5","default":"<p>How long until I see results?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_6","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_6","default":"<p>Can I cancel my subscription anytime?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_7","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_7","default":"<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_8","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_8","default":"<p>Will FusiForce cause bloating or stomach issues?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_9","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_9","default":"<p>What is the best time to take FusiForce gummies?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_10","label":"ggq3keBygNw_childItem_10","default":"<p>Can I take FusiForce with protein powder or other supplements?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglhMWzvXgh_text","label":"gglhMWzvXgh_text","default":"<p>Most creatine gummies on the market contain little to no actual creatine or use cheap, untested forms. FusiForce is third-party verified with full clinical dosing (5g per serving) and zero fillers. We test every batch so you know exactly what you're getting - real creatine that actually works. No hidden COAs, no \"email us for reports.\" The proof is here before you buy. Plus, we test AFTER cooking - not before - because creatine degrades with heat.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghNwguXnDu_text","label":"gghNwguXnDu_text","default":"<p>Yes. Creatine is highly effective for women. Many female users report better strength, endurance, and body composition without any masculinizing effects.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-GPgr7oko_text","label":"gg-GPgr7oko_text","default":"<p>Each serving (5 gummies) delivers a full <strong>5 grams of pure creatine monohydrate</strong> - the clinically effective dose used in studies for strength, power, and muscle growth.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggd_m1qjlFK_text","label":"ggd_m1qjlFK_text","default":"<p>Yes. Every batch is tested by ISO 17025 accredited labs for purity, potency, and label accuracy. We publish the results so you can see the proof yourself.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfV9SqzxeK_text","label":"ggfV9SqzxeK_text","default":"<p>It took us 2 years to solve the melting problem. Each 3-gummy serving is pre-portioned and protected. Toss one in your gym bag without a container. No sticky mess.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdJBwNO2zB_text","label":"ggdJBwNO2zB_text","default":"<p>Most users notice initial improvements within 2-3 weeks. 94% report improved energy by day 14. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results — which is why we offer a 90-day guarantee.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXhv7eNyBK_text","label":"ggXhv7eNyBK_text","default":"<p>Yes! Cancel anytime via text in 10 seconds. Zero commitment. You can also pause, skip, or modify delivery dates through your account.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsDaH-NNbl_text","label":"ggsDaH-NNbl_text","default":"<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the pouch is empty. That's how confident we are.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkd77RN1Gk_text","label":"ggkd77RN1Gk_text","default":"<p>Unlike traditional creatine powder, FusiForce is formulated to minimize bloating. Most users report no stomach discomfort because the gummies use a high-quality, highly soluble form of creatine.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggByPt_ss9U_text","label":"ggByPt_ss9U_text","default":"<p>Any time of day works, but most people prefer taking them with breakfast or post-workout for consistent daily levels. Consistency matters more than perfect timing.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaqwztj3uB_text","label":"ggaqwztj3uB_text","default":"<p>Yes. FusiForce mixes perfectly with protein shakes, pre-workouts, or any other supplement. There are no known negative interactions.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
